ul!\",\n26:       \"createdAt\": \"2026-03-16T17:55:20Z\",\n27:       \"includesCreatedEdit\": false,\n28:       \"isMinimized\": false,\n29:       \"minimizedReason\": \"\",\n30:       \"reactionGroups\": [\n31:         {\n32:           \"content\": \"THUMBS_UP\",\n33:           \"users\": {\n34:             \"totalCount\": 1\n35:           }\n36:         }\n37:       ],\n38:       \"url\": \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/10030#issuecomment-4069555896\",\n39:       \"viewerDidAuthor\": false\n40:     },\n41:     {\n42:       \"id\": \"IC_kwDOBjach87yk-H2\",\n43:       \"author\": {\n44:         \"login\": \"sabrinatoro\"\n45:       },\n46:       \"authorAssociation\": \"MEMBER\",\n47:       \"body\": \"@matentzn we discussed this in the past (We can follow-up in a meeting)\\nWe need a more drastic-large scale approach.\",\n48:       \"createdAt\": \"2026-03-16T18:35:25Z\",\n49:       \"includesCreatedEdit\": false,\n50:       \"isMinimized\": false,\n51:       \"minimizedReason\": \"\",\n52:       \"reactionGroups\": [],\n53:       \"url\": \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/10030#issuecomment-4069777910\",\n54:       \"viewerDidAuthor\": false\n55:     }\n56:   ],\n57:   \"title\": \"Incorrect synonyms for MONDO_0001628\",\n58:   \"url\": \"https://github.com/monarch-initiative/mondo/issues/10030\"\n59: }\n\n(End of file - total 59 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"{\n  \"body\": \"This term \\\"tinea unguium\\\" refers to a fungal infection of the nails. However, the exact synonyms include infections of various other body parts. These seem to have been added by mistake.\\n\\nFor example:\\ncellulitis and abscess of buttock\\ncellulitis and abscess of face\\ncellulitis and abscess of gluteal region\\ncellulitis and abscess of trunk\\ncellulitis and abscess of upper arm and forearm\",\n  \"comments\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"IC_kwDOBjach87ykHkW\",\n      \"author\": {\n        \"login\": \"matentzn\"\n      },\n    