{"type":"text","timestamp":1778616053489,"sessionID":"ses_1e23e59e9ffePr4rKIZ3LfLUyq","part":{"id":"prt_e1dc6f45f001GvkCDKpQFRYtVl","messageID":"msg_e1dc6d0f5001OvwghbPMKPCOmO","sessionID":"ses_1e23e59e9ffePr4rKIZ3LfLUyq","type":"text","text":"The task is complete. Here's what was done:\n\n**Issue #10030** reported that MONDO:0001628 (\"tinea unguium,\" a fungal nail infection) contained incorrect exact synonyms describing bacterial cellulitis and abscess of various body parts — these were erroneously imported from DOID:13074.\n\n**Changes made to `src/ontology/mondo-edit.obo`:**\n- Removed 8 incorrect synonyms:\n  - `cellulitis and abscess` (RELATED)\n  - `cellulitis and abscess of buttock` (EXACT)\n  - `cellulitis and abscess of face` (EXACT)\n  - `cellulitis and abscess of finger` (EXACT)\n  - `cellulitis and abscess of finger and toe` (EXACT)\n  - `cellulitis and abscess of gluteal region` (EXACT)\n  - `cellulitis and abscess of trunk` (EXACT)\n  - `cellulitis and abscess of upper arm and forearm` (EXACT)\n- Removed incorrect xref `ICD9:681.9` (cellulitis and abscess of unspecified digit)\n- Added term tracker item linking to issue #10030\n\n**Validation performed:**\n- ODK normalization (`make NORM`)\n- Syntax check with `robot convert` — passed with no errors\n\n**Files created:**\n- `ISSUE_COMMENTS.md` — concise update for the originating issue\n- `PR_COMMENTS.md` — detailed changelog and rationale\n\n**Commit:** `43e5c91` on branch `scribe-v1-ai4curation-mondo-agent-config-v3-.-togetherai-moonshotai-Kimi-K2.6-iter1-issue-10030`","time":{"start":1778616038495,"end":1778616053487}}}
